400.description:
`VALIDATION_ERROR` for a bad parameter; `INVALID_CURSOR` for a cursor that is malformed or was issued for another stream or organization;
`CURSOR_FILTER_MISMATCH` when the filters differ from the ones the cursor was issued with;
`SINCE_BEFORE_RETENTION` when `since` is older than the stream keeps.

